ilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_scurry", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·密林奔走", "name_en": "Scurry", "description_zh": "森海飞霞在短时间内获得移动速度加成，相位移动状态和穿行树木效果。开启时林渊旅人的转向几率为%evasion_multiplier%倍。", "description_en": "Hoodwink gains bonus movement speed, phased movement, and tree-walking for a brief time. While active, the redirect chance of Mistwoods Wayfarer is multiplied by %evasion_multiplier%.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movement_speed_pct", "duration", "radius", "evasion_multiplier", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_decoy", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·诱敌奇术", "name_en": "Decoy", "description_zh": "森海飞霞变为隐身，提升移动速度，并且产生一个引诱敌人的幻象，幻象会瞄准最近的敌方英雄开始蓄力准备发射伤害较低的一箭穿心。如果幻象被攻击或被指向性技能击中，幻象将被摧毁并且攻击者将受到较弱的野地奇袭效果。", "description_en": "Hoodwink turns invisible, increasing her movement speed, and creates a decoy illusion that starts aiming a decreased damage Sharpshooter at the nearest enemy hero. If the illusion is attacked or hit by a targeted ability, it is destroyed and it throws a lesser bushwhack towards the enemy.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "decoy_detonate_radius", "decoy_stun_duration", "images_do_damage_percent", "images_take_damage_percent", "projectile_speed", "movement_speed", "sharpshooter_damage_pct", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_hunters_boomerang", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·猎手旋镖", "name_en": "Hunter's Boomerang", "description_zh": "掷出一把沿弧线飞行的回旋镖。击中后会飞回至森海飞霞。回旋镖对沿途击中的敌人都会造成伤害，并且施加一个负面效果，使受到作用的敌人被减速，承受的技能伤害增加。", "description_en": "Tosses a boomerang in an arc. Upon contact, it returns to Hoodwink.  The boomerang will deal damage as it passes through or hits enemies, and apply a debuff that causes affected enemies to be slowed and be more vulnerable to spell damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "radius", "damage", "mark_duration", "slow_pct", "spell_amp", "spread", "min_throw_duration", "max_throw_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_sharpshooter", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·一箭穿心", "name_en": "Sharpshooter", "description_zh": "森海飞霞装载她的弩机，射出致命的一箭，对一名敌方英雄造成高额伤害，并施加破坏和减速效果。伤害和负面状态持续时间随着装载时间增加，%max_charge_time%秒后达到最大效果，弩箭在%misfire_time%秒后自动发射。\n由于弩箭的威力，森海飞霞后退%recoil_distance%距离。弩箭穿过的非英雄单位会受到半额伤害。", "description_en": "Hoodwink charges up and fires a deadly bolt from her crossbow, dealing heavy damage, break and slow to an enemy Hero.  The damage and debuff duration scale up to max after %max_charge_time% seconds, and the bolt is fired automatically after %misfire_time% seconds.\nHoodwink is knocked backwards for a distance of %recoil_distance% from the force of the shot. Creeps hit by the bolt are damaged for half the values.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升箭矢速度和减速效果。", "en": "Increases arrow speed and movement speed slow."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["arrow_speed", "arrow_width", "arrow_range", "arrow_vision", "max_charge_time", "max_damage", "recoil_distance", "recoil_height", "recoil_duration", "max_slow_debuff_duration", "misfire_time", "slow_move_pct", "turn_rate", "turn_rate_tooltip", "vision_along_indicator"]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_mistwoods_wayfarer", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·林渊旅人", "name_en": "Mistwoods Wayfarer", "description_zh": "森海飞霞有几率使敌人的攻击转向至附近的树木。", "description_en": "Hoodwink has a chance to redirect enemy attacks to a nearby tree.", "notes_zh": ["受到转向攻击的树木会被摧毁。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["radius", "redirect_chance"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_fire_wreath", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·星破天惊", "name_en": "Starbreaker", "description_zh": "破晓辰星将她的战锤旋转3次，对敌人造成攻击伤害以及额外伤害。最后一次打击时，她将战锤击向地面，对她前方的敌人造成眩晕和伤害。", "description_en": "Dawnbreaker whirls her hammer around 3 times, damaging