istance_threshold", "range", "hammer_solar_guardian_radius"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_luminosity", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·熠熠生辉", "name_en": "Luminosity", "description_zh": "破晓辰星在数次攻击后提升了力量，她的下一次攻击会造成致命一击，并治疗她附近%heal_radius%范围内所有友方英雄，治疗量为攻击伤害的一定百分比。攻击小兵和野怪产生的治疗量有所减少。对友军的治疗量为%allied_healing_pct%%%。", "description_en": "After a number of attacks, Dawnbreaker powers up, charging her next attack with a critical hit that heals all allied heroes within %heal_radius% units around her for a portion of attack damage dealt. Creeps and neutral enemies provide less healing. Allies are healed for %allied_healing_pct%%% of the amount.", "notes_zh": ["熠熠生辉的治疗效果可以通过生命回复增强效果获得提升。", "破坏会使技能无法获得新的叠加效果。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["attack_count", "heal_radius", "heal_pct", "heal_from_creeps", "bonus_damage", "allied_healing_pct", "cooldown_reduction", "triggered_by_celestial_hammer"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_break_of_dawn", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·辰星破晓", "name_en": "Break of Dawn", "description_zh": "只要太阳出来，破晓辰星就会获得基础攻击力加成和额外视野，加成效果会在整个白天内逐渐降低。如果是破晓辰星制造的白天，在整个白天时间内加成效果始终是最大值。", "description_en": "Whenever the sun comes out, Dawnbreaker gains bonus base damage and vision that decreases throughout the course of the day. If Dawnbreaker causes the day these bonuses are at full power for the entirety of that daytime.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "辰星破晓提供治疗增强，数值等于当前攻击力提升。", "en": "Break of Dawn provides healing amplification equal to the current damage increase."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["day_threshold", "max_dmg_pct", "max_vision_pct", "current_dmg_tooltip", "current_vision_tooltip", "heal_amp"]}, {"subject": "dawnbreaker_solar_guardian", "name_zh": "破晓辰星·天光现世", "name_en": "Solar Guardian", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 破晓辰星在地图上任意友方英雄%max_offset_distance%距离内的一个地点创造一个脉冲效果，并制造持续%daytime_duration%秒的白天。每次脉冲都会对敌人造成伤害，并治疗友军。经过一段短暂时间后，她飞向目标地点，落地时造成额外伤害并眩晕敌人。开始持续施法后，破晓辰星无法中止此技能。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Dawnbreaker creates a pulsing effect at a location within %max_offset_distance% units of an allied hero anywhere on the map and creates daylight for %daytime_duration%s. Each pulse damages enemies and heals allies.After a short duration, she flies to the target location and deals additional damage and stuns enemies upon landing.Once channeled, Dawnbreaker cannot stop the ability.", "notes_zh": ["脉冲间隔为%pulse_interval%秒。", "总飞行时间为%abilitychanneltime%秒持续施法时间 + %airtime_duration%秒飞行时间。", "施放时立刻召回战锤。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "天光现世的光环在破晓辰星落地后会跟随%scepter_aura_duration%秒。", "en": "Solar Guardian's aura follows Dawnbreaker for %scepter_aura_duration%s after landing."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["scepter_aura_duration", "miss_rate", "base_heal", "radius", "base_damage", "pulse_interval", "land_damage", "land_stun_duration", "max_offset_distance", "scepter_channel_time", "airtime_scepter_bonus", "airtime_scepter_movement_speed", "airtime_duration", "daytime_duration", "AbilityChannelTime"]}, {"subject": "marci_grapple", "name_zh": "玛西·过肩摔", "name_en": "Dispose", "description_zh": "玛西抓起一个友方或敌方目标，将其轻松地向她身后摔去，敌方目标将受到伤害并被减速。落地区域内所有敌方单位也会受到伤害并被减速。", "description_en": "Marci grabs an allied or enemy target and throws it effortlessly behind her, damaging and slowing the unit if it's an enemy. Any enemy units in the landing area will also be damaged and slowed.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["landing_radius", "air_duration", "air_height", "pull_offset", "throw_distance_behind", "pull_angle", "debuff_duration", "impact_damage", "movement_slow_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "marci_companion_run", "name_zh": "玛西·回身踢", "name_en": "Rebound", "description_zh": "玛西跃向友方目标单位，选好她要弹离的方向和距离。到达目标后玛西冲向最终的目的地，对落地点的敌人造成伤害和眩晕。\n\n回身踢设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后，玛西会把她的友军目标带向最终目的地。\n\n友军将获得%ally_movespeed_pct%%%移动速度加成，持续%ally_buff_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Marci bounds to the targeted allied unit, choosing a direction and distance she will spring away from it. Upon reaching the unit, Marci lunges to her final destination, damaging and stunning enemies where she lands.\n\nWhen Rebound is set to alt-cast, Marci brings the target ally with her to her final destination.\n\n The ally receives %ally_movespeed_pct%%% bonus movement speed for %ally_buff_duration%s.", "notes_zh": ["玛西冲刺时目标单位可以躲避该效果。", "不会触发法术反弹。", "多样施法时不会带走被缠绕或束缚的友军。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "提升伤害。回身踢可以对敌人施放，并且玛西施放后自身也会获得加速效果。", "en": "Increases damage. Rebound can be cast on enemies, and causes Marci to also get the speed boost when she casts it."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["move_speed", "max_jump_distance", "landing_radius", "impact_damage", "debuff_duration", "min_lob_travel_time", "max_lob_travel_time", "min_height_above_lowest", "min_height_above_highest", "min_acceleration", "max_acceleration", "vector_preview_radius", "ally_buff_duration", "ally_movespeed_pct", "impact_position_offset"]}, {"subject": "marci_bodyguard", "name_zh": "玛西·护卫术", "name_en": "Bodyguard", "description_zh": "被动使玛西获得吸血和攻击力加成。\n\n对友军施放时，使其获得她的%max_partner_penalty%%%被动吸血和攻击力加成。另外马上还会给她和她的搭档制造共用的全伤害护盾。在玛西攻击英雄时，造成伤害的%shared_barrier_replenish_amount%%%会补充护盾。", "description_en": "Passively grants Marci lifesteal and bonus attack damage.\n\nWhen cast on an ally, she provides them with %max_partner_penalty%%% of her passive lifesteal and attack damage bonus. Additionally Marci creates a shared all damage barrier for herself and her partner. As Marci attacks heroes, %shared_barrier_replenish_amount%%% of the damage dealt restores the barrier.", "notes_zh": ["玛西无法对自身施放护卫术。", "吸血效果对非英雄单位减少%creep_lifesteal_reduction_pct%%%。", "不论是玛西或她的搭档受到伤害都会使共用护盾的数值减少。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bodyguard_duration", "lifesteal_pct", "bonus_damage", "creep_lifesteal_reduction_pct", "bodyguard_attack_range_buffer", "max_partner_penalty", "counter_cooldown", "shared_barrier", "strong_dispel", "shared_barrier_replenish_amount", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "marci_special_delivery", "name_zh": "玛西·特快专递", "name_en": "Special Delivery", "description_zh": "玛西吹起口哨，立刻把她的信使传送到她身边。如果信使起始于泉水，它会带上玛西储藏处内的物品。传送后会把这些物品移交给玛西，再返回泉水。所有友方信使被动获得%bonus_levels%级额外等级和%bonus_hp_tooltip%点额外生命。", "description_en": "Marci whistles to instantly summon her courier to her. If the courier started in the fountain, it will take items from Marci's stash. After teleporting it will transfer these items to Marci and head back to the fountain.Passively grants all allied couriers %bonus_levels% bonus levels and %bonus_hp_tooltip% bonus health.", "notes_zh": ["特快专递的口哨具有%abilitycastpoint%秒施法前摇。", "如果信使施放后没有移交任何物品，或还拥有物品，它都会停留在玛西身边。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_levels", "courier_max_level", "bonus_hp", "bonus_hp_tooltip", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "marci_unleash", "name_zh": "玛西·怒拳破", "name_en": "Unleash", "description_zh": "玛西释放潜藏的力量，获得狂怒的猛攻效果，使自身可以发动快速的打击，并且降低打击目标的移动和攻击速度，持续%pulse_debuff_duration%秒。每次狂怒连技的最后一击都会创造一个脉冲效果，对目标周围的敌人造成伤害。在狂怒连技的间隔，玛西无法攻击，持续%time_between_flurries%秒。\n\n玛西施放怒拳破时移动速度提升%bonus_movespeed%%%。", "description_en": "Marci taps a hidden power, gaining Fury charges that allow her to deliver a rapid sequence of strikes that slow movement and attack speed of the target for %pulse_debuff_duration%s. The last strike in every Fury combo creates a damaging pulse around the target. In between Fury combos, Marci is unable to attack for %time_between_flurries%s.\n\nMarci gains %bonus_movespeed%%% movement speed when Unleash is cast.", "notes_zh": ["每次狂怒连技开始后，每次攻击都必须在1秒内完成，否则连技将会终止。", "移除攻击速度限制。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "怒拳破的冷却时间减少%scepter_cooldown_reduction%秒，并且施放时对玛西施加弱驱散。怒拳破生效期间，玛西的所有技能在施放时都会施放脉冲。玛西的所有怒拳破脉冲都会沉默敌人，持续%pulse_silence_duration%秒。驱散类型：弱驱散", "en": "Reduces Unleash cooldown by %scepter_cooldown_reduction% seconds and causes Unleash to apply a basic dispel on Marci. While Unleash is Active, all of Marci's abilities unleash pulses when cast. All of Marci's unleash pulses will silence units for %pulse_silence_duration% seconds.DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel"}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "charges_per_flurry", "flurry_bonus_attack_speed", "time_between_flurries", "pulse_radius", "pulse_debuff_duration", "pulse_damage", "pulse_move_slow_pct", "pulse_attack_slow_pct", "max_time_window_per_hit", "bonus_movespeed", "recovery_fixed_attack_rate", "shard_push_length", "scepter_cooldown_reduction", "dispel"]}, {"subject": "primal_beast_onslaught", "name_zh": "獸·突", "name_en": "Onslaught", "description_zh": "獸积蓄力量再向选定方向冲去，将敌人和队友同时击退。敌方单位被撞时受到伤害，并且被眩晕。蓄力时间越长，獸冲的距离越远。\n\n可以随时使用停止指令来中止。", "description_en": "Primal Beast charges up and then runs in the chosen direction, knocking back enemies and allies alike. Enemy units are damaged and stunned on impact. The longer the charge duration, the farther Primal Beast's momentum will carry him. \n\n Can be cancelled at any time with the Stop command.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["charge_speed", "chargeup_time", "knockback_radius", "max_distance", "knockback_distance", "knockback_damage", "knockback_duration", "max_charge_time", "turn_rate", "base_power", "movement_turn_rate", "stun_duration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "primal_beast_trample", "name_zh": "獸·踏", "name_en": "Trample", "description_zh": "獸践踏一切。每行进%step_distance%距离就会对獸附近范围内所有敌人造成伤害。伤害量为基础伤害加上獸攻击力的一定系数。獸在技能期间被缴械。", "description_en": "Primal Beast stomps over everything. For every %step_distance% units traveled, all enemies around the Beast receive damage. Deals base damage plus a multiplier of Primal Beast's attack damage. Primal Beast is disarmed for the duration of the ability.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["effect_radius", "step_distance", "base_damage", "duration", "attack_damage", "bonus_magic_resistance", "unslowable", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "primal_beast_uproar", "name_zh": "獸·咤", "name_en": "Uproar", "description_zh": "獸的脾性使獸每次受到的敌方英雄伤害超过%damage_limit%点后就会获得咤的叠加效果。\n\n主动施放后，獸释放出咆哮声，减速附近敌人，并且獸根据咤的当前叠加层数获得额外攻击力和护甲，持续%roar_duration%秒。", "description_en": "The Beast's temper causes every instance of %damage_limit% hero damage or more to grant a stack of Uproar.  \n\n When activated, Primal Beast releases a roar that slows surrounding enemies and grants the Beast additional attack damage and armor for %roar_duration% seconds based on his current stacks of Uproar.", "notes_zh": ["獸对自身造成伤害无法获得咤的叠加效果。", "破坏会使技能无法获得新的叠加效果。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "獸开启咤时，以自身为圆心施放出%projectile_waves%波弹道，每波每层咤的叠加效果有%projectiles_per_stack%个弹道。弹道造成伤害并对击中的敌人施加破坏效果。经过短暂延迟后每个弹道会分裂成两个。", "en": "When Primal Beast activates Uproar, he releases %projectile_waves% waves of %projectiles_per_stack% projectiles per stack of uproar each in a circle around him. Projectiles deal damage and Break enemies hit. After a short delay, each projectile splinters in two."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_damage_per_stack", "stack_limit", "damage_limit", "stack_duration", "move_slow_per_stack", "slow_duration", "damage_min", "damage_max", "radius", "roared_bonus_armor", "roar_duration", "should_dispell", "projectiles_per_stack", "projectile_distance", "projectile_width"]}, {"subject": "primal_beast_rock_throw", "name_zh": "獸·砸", "name_en": "Rock Throw", "description_zh": "獸向目标地点扔出一块岩石，对敌人造成眩晕和伤害。岩石无法扔向獸身边的最小范围内。岩石落地后会分裂成3块碎石，落在初始目标地点的后方。砸每击中一名英雄都会增加咤的一层叠加效果。", "description_en": "Primal Beast throws a rock at the target location that stuns and damages enemies. The rock cannot be thrown within a minimum range of Primal Beast. After landing, the rock splits into 3 additional fragments that land behind the initial target location. Rock Throw increases stacks of Uproar for each hero hit.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["base_damage", "impact_radius", "min_range", "min_travel_time", "max_travel_time", "bounce_travel_time", "stun_duration", "fragment_impact_distance", "fragment_impact_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "primal_beast_pulverize", "name_zh": "獸·捶", "name_en": "Pulverize", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 獸释放出他的怒火，抓起敌方目标，反复将其向地面捶击，对范围内所有敌人造成伤害和短暂眩晕。每次连续击中会造成额外伤害。持续%channel_time%秒。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Primal Beast channels his rage, grabbing the target enemy and slamming them into the ground repeatedly, damaging and mini-stunning any enemies caught in the AoE. Each consecutive hit deals bonus damage. Lasts %channel_time% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["splash_radius", "interval", "ministun", "cast_range", "animation_rate", "damage", "channel_time", "bonus_damage_per_hit", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
